     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I&#39;ve now built R/qtl2 for R version 3.6, at <a href=\"http://rqtl.org/qtl2cran\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rqtl.org/qtl2cran&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483930211000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3DqQz6mgpIMiAGt02Ew_Fz\">http://rqtl.org/qtl2cran</a></div><div><br></div><div>If you upgrade R from version 3.5 to 3.6, you need to reinstall all packages. You can reinstall the R/qtl2 packages with:</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">     update.packages(ask=FALSE, checkBuilt=TRUE, <br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">                     repos=&quot;<a href=\"http://rqtl.org/qtl2cran\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rqtl.org/qtl2cran&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483930211000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3DqQz6mgpIMiAGt02Ew_Fz\">http://rqtl.org/qtl2cran</a>&quot;)</span></div><div><br></div><div>Upgrade the rest of your packages with:</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">     update.packages(ask=FALSE, checkBuilt=TRUE) <br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"></span>       </div><div>karl<br></div></div>"
